  "description": "RoutesList is a powerful .NET tool for visualizing and analyzing all routes in your application with clarity and\n      precision.\n      It provides comprehensive inspection of HTTP methods, URIs, controllers, actions, middleware and routing\n      configurations.\n      Features include customizable output formats, filtering options, and detailed route information display.\n      Fully compatible with .NET Core 3.1, .NET 5.0, .NET 6.0, .NET 7.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 9.0 and supports Razor Pages, ASP.NET MVC,\n      and Blazor Server applications.",
